  <p>
    <strong>Key Takeaway:</strong> Gravity affects virtually every aspect of daily life, from blood circulation
    to building design, cooking to sports, technology to sleep. We've evolved and designed our world around this
    constant force, and most of its effects are so fundamental we don't consciously notice them. Understanding
    these effects helps us appreciate how deeply gravity shapes human experience.
  </p>
